{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8b7a9db84e34221e54c294045b75950a6902395e5c826317d6ae0869cade5c03", "ja": "（環に誘われて、大神家にお邪魔することになった。\nいつもより元気な環の案内で、家に向かっている……）", "zh": "（受环邀请，我要去大神家做客了。在比平时更有活力的环带领下，我们正朝她家走去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "e249c5c2b0b1fbab4e7d8778000fa737b6f15d74beb50781e71e46964f403f79", "ja": "雪が積もったから、いつもよりちょっと寒いかも。\nおやぶん、大丈夫？　寒くない？", "zh": "因为积雪了，可能会比平时稍微冷一点。\n老大，你没事吧？不冷吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f0d8c0425840d898ca4a8ce973902a025b123f6735814da04665ea275ccd9ee9", "ja": "心配してくれてありがとう。\n環こそ、風邪をひかないようにな。", "zh": "谢谢你关心我。\n环也要注意别感冒了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "118771d2530d90d85cde424f6647e7d593ebda9339691083f64db70e2eeaa843", "ja": "うん、大丈夫！\nだってたまき、寒いのへっちゃらだもん！", "zh": "嗯，没问题！\n因为环才不怕冷呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "c62a18fb1f48b96943b9c3980e9c2a56b95c188fa544b3128600b1c1f8ae5d43", "ja": "あっ！　おやぶんストップ～！\n……ふぅ。おっこちちゃうとこだったね。", "zh": "啊！老大快停下～！\n……呼。差点就要掉下去了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1d89dd2846774ec8543450baa75be0f6ca98440f8647cd0c9bcaab260d43417a", "ja": "えっ？　ああ、溝になってたのか。\n雪で隠れてて、気がつかなかったよ。ありがとな。", "zh": "咦？啊，原来那里是条沟啊。\n被雪盖住了，没注意到。谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "dd4f3af753ef20e18de6ca8285c5e67890b5a0297c77000ffd6980542790f044", "ja": "えへへ。今日は道がこおってるからゆっくり歩いてね。\nすべったら大変だぞ！　それからそれから……。", "zh": "嘿嘿。今天路面结冰了，所以要慢慢走哦。\n要是滑倒了可就糟糕了！还有还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d20f2beacec80920437cb0d9a13691e6a531366cf4227ae09602edd1c4f92011", "ja": "ははっ。今日の環は頼もしいな。\nなんだかお姉さんって感じだ。", "zh": "哈哈，今天的环真可靠啊。\n感觉就像个姐姐一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "fd6e345bf754ae2d8627a3136beafa93fd940d805729a907234cabd934d8dce8", "ja": "えっ、ホント！？\nたまき、お姉さんみたいにみえる？", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？\n环看起来像姐姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d3cbbb77cc1aac7cee225a85e0d768c0c65ab61fced73064e40ad11136b64657", "ja": "ああ。道案内もできてるし、\n周りのことも気遣えてえらいぞ。", "zh": "嗯。你既能带路，\n又能照顾到周围的人，真棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "01759e4c248f9d09eb7d5f9c07fd970e4221bf0f88c2ae3cf0c4d24dc0df46f4", "ja": "くふふ♪　やったぞ～！\nたまき、ちゃんとおもてなしできてるんだねっ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪成功啦～！\n环，好好地招待到客人了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "558aadb38ad207e44800725c5f6d9bdb76604e414714ee1876542ab4edaa9674", "ja": "出かける前に、お母さんに言われたんだ。\n「おやぶんをしっかり、おもてなししなさい」って！", "zh": "出门前，妈妈对我说：\n“要好好招待大将哦！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6d80c585e44ba69ff7cbf5667319703b6b9e390e5605475f61d82e137a716098", "ja": "そうか。それで心配してくれたりしたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。所以你才会担心我啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "16cfaa4bab726367f72ced3f14728e1ed0cd3019ac9920a37993cf21868f0a41", "ja": "でも、それだけじゃないよ！　たまき、\nおやぶんにお世話してもらってばっかりでしょ？", "zh": "不过，不只是这样哦！小环一直都受老大照顾，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "041db6f3eefb207ab28307df5745eca23e53c3e54270fbe1878cf20316e18eb4", "ja": "だからね、今日はおやぶんのこと、\nいっぱいお世話してあげるって決めたんだ！", "zh": "所以呢，我决定今天要好好照顾大将！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e45e2bc23907f0334e83f6741ebd54be16246b724f600b336358aca356fecd71", "ja": "そうだったのか……。ありがとな。\nそれじゃ、お言葉に甘えて……はっくしょん！", "zh": "原来是这样啊……谢谢你。\n那我就恭敬不如从命了……哈啾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "b700a820e749481cdc4c1f31e27baabc053886353bf68aedc438ecbd7ffaf0d4", "ja": "おやぶん！？　やっぱり寒かったんだね。\nむー……たまき、言ってほしかったぞ。", "zh": "老大！？果然还是觉得冷啊。\n呜——环想让你告诉我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "0d14c2223a3ad60a71445bea705877554b26d60c78cf8f1605f259363538fdf7", "ja": "ねえ、おやぶん。たまきと手つなごう！\nそれなら、おやぶんもたまきも温かくなるでしょ♪", "zh": "呐，老大。和环牵手吧！\n这样一来，老大和环都会暖和起来，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1692f649b478df09392d5c3da444459134cb0921bb6696da7b5b03d8e6b563f3", "ja": "そうだな。今日は環の言うとおりにするよ。\n環のおもてなし、お願いするな。", "zh": "说得也是。今天就按环说的来吧。那就拜托环好好招待我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0334_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "0841a9740164780236ae2ef71be15eadc127a5a4a6c8244da3f2238071d79b7a", "ja": "任せてっ！　たまき、ちゃんとご案内するぞ～！\nしっかり付いてきてね、おやぶん♪", "zh": "交给我吧！　环会好好带路的哦～！\n要紧紧跟上来哦，大将♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
